Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, curl, ca-certificates
Description: private local Russian voice typing with GigaAM v3
 GigaType records from the system microphone, transcribes locally with the
 GigaAM v3 RNN-T ONNX model, and inserts Russian text into the focused app.
